.\" "Generated by swift-argument-parser"
.Dd May 12, 1996
.Dt DEFAULT-AS-FLAG 9
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm default-as-flag
.Nd "A utility demonstrating defaultAsFlag options."
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Ar subcommand
.Op Fl -string-flag Op Ar string-flag
.Op Fl -number-flag Op Ar number-flag
.Op Fl -bool-flag Op Ar bool-flag
.Op Fl -transform-flag Op Ar transform-flag
.Op Fl -format Ns Op Ns = Ns Ar format
.Op Fl -level Ns = Ns Ar level
.Op Fl -regular Ar regular
.Op Ar additional-args...
.Op Fl -help
.Sh DESCRIPTION
This command shows how defaultAsFlag options can work both as flags
and as options with values.
.Bl -tag -width 6n
.It Fl -string-flag Op Ar string-flag
A string option with defaultAsFlag.
.It Fl -number-flag Op Ar number-flag
An integer option with defaultAsFlag.
.It Fl -bool-flag Op Ar bool-flag
A boolean option with defaultAsFlag.
.It Fl -transform-flag Op Ar transform-flag
A string option with transform and defaultAsFlag.
.It Fl -format Ns Op Ns = Ns Ar format
An attached-only string option with defaultAsFlag.
.It Fl -level Ns = Ns Ar level
An attached-only integer option.
.It Fl r , -regular Ar regular
A regular option for comparison.
.It Ar additional-args...
.It Fl h , -help
Show help information.
.El
.Sh "SEE ALSO"
.Xr default-as-flag.help 9
